## Conclusion

The workflow file is byte-identical in both trees. The only difference is its depth: at <git root>/.github/workflows it is discovered and runs; one level below, GitHub reports zero workflows and zero runs. This is a direct measurement of the wrapper trap, not an inference from a missing badge.

After the repair in this delivery the workflow sits at <git root>/.github/workflows/backend.yml,
which is the control layout. `bash tools/check_layout.sh` verifies it locally in 0.1s.
